    "steam_appid": 2686520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/505adc2da893dc73362b9b058f959755.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>More Than Human is a open-world adventure game where you journey as many animals to stop a great, ancient evil. You will befriend humans and animals alike, fight countless enemies and explore the secrets of the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cda82a4e156c67569f1eed555dd5a937.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>You will take many forms, predator and prey, to explore and navigate the world. Swim, Run, Gallop, Fly, Jump; do what ever it takes to get to the end. Master your animal forms and use your skills to find the path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/dabdfd5495bb1a994e8fd2c24fd7c017.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>Your journey will have you meet many groups of animals. It will be your job to convince them you are on their side. As a Human who can take almost any form you want, you will have the unique perspective of existing on both sides. Choose carefully what form you take, as you can become a predator or prey in an instant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/7fa6b6a7d6bbcccacc9ad94f68ac76c9.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>This world is vast. You will travel many different environments and biomes throughout your journey. Use your animal forms to traverse and make your own path. <br><br>The animal groups you meet will present you many advantages and challenges. They can help you overcome enemies and puzzles, or possible block your path of progression. It all depends on you interact and form your connection with them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cc5976a4a8cb33f1893e4c2ace73fd14.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/505adc2da893dc73362b9b058f959755.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>More Than Human is a open-world adventure game where you journey as many animals to stop a great, ancient evil. You will befriend humans and animals alike, fight countless enemies and explore the secrets of the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/b3668a70cf054ef928f2532e0da85ecb.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/cda82a4e156c67569f1eed555dd5a937.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>You will take many forms, predator and prey, to explore and navigate the world. Swim, Run, Gallop, Fly, Jump; do what ever it takes to get to the end. Master your animal forms and use your skills to find the path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/aed3186aacf51a0c6ec485956f9d2f6c.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/dabdfd5495bb1a994e8fd2c24fd7c017.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>Your journey will have you meet many groups of animals. It will be your job to convince them you are on their side. As a Human who can take almost any form you want, you will have the unique perspective of existing on both sides. Choose carefully what form you take, as you can become a predator or prey in an instant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/fb5898cde273cf7baaa6e3095fc12d1b.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/7fa6b6a7d6bbcccacc9ad94f68ac76c9.webp?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br>This world is vast. You will travel many different environments and biomes throughout your journey. Use your animal forms to traverse and make your own path. <br><br>The animal groups you meet will present you many advantages and challenges. They can help you overcome enemies and puzzles, or possible block your path of progression. It all depends on you interact and form your connection with them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.poster.avif?t=1701308373\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.webm?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686520/extras/6ecebba6e725007a208954e4760eaf1d.mp4?t=1701308373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
